        "official_en_sha256": "1ccb582ad0ccbbe4205a62ebfb12d171d766f20a8f2b7f5b6f56b90a8577410a"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "「敵の必殺をいなすには様々な手段がある。\r\n逆鱗に触れぬように気をつけよ」\r\nだってさ。",
        "official_en": "It says, “There are many ways that one may know, to evade a foe’s most deadly blow—think carefully, think guilefully; lest you end in certain woe.”",
        "real_en": "It says, 'There are many ways to fend off an enemy's deadliest attack. Be careful not to provoke its wrath.'"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
