      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "なるほどねぇ。\r\nレイン、ありゃボムの一種だぜ。\r\n必殺……つまり、爆発には気をつけろってことだな。",
        "official_en": "I see where this is going. That looks like the buff brother of a bomb, so the “deadly blow” part is telling us to watch out for its explosion.",
        "real_en": "I see. That's a kind of bomb, Rain. 'Deadliest attack' probably means its explosion. Watch out."
      },
